# =============================================================================
# WAVE 2 — STOCK CAST (jak1 shipped NPC rigs, keyed by JOINT-GEO name)
# Same solver, same tuning scale as the -hd blocks above. Params are the phase
# archetypes verbatim; only radius= is adapted to the limb/prop it wraps.
# A section header may alias several jgeo names (level variants of one actor).
# Deliberately NOT chained: humanoid ears, held props (staffs/canes/axes/jugs/
# baskets/cages/dynamite/wings/tongues/jaws/helmets/tanks/tubes/lamps), and
# butt/glute jiggle (jak1 ships no such joint on any rig).
# =============================================================================

